cff-version: 1.2.0
title: PACKAGE
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Erika
    family-names: Cui
    email: meiying.cui@yale.edu
    affiliation: Yale University
repository-code: 'https://github.com/mc3365/PACKAGE'
abstract: >-
  PACKAGE is a modular Python framework for single-molecule epigenomic analysis
  of Oxford Nanopore long-read data. It provides validated extraction orchestration,
  HDF5-backed storage, regional queries, and visualization at single-molecule
  resolution.
keywords:
  - fiber-seq
  - long-read sequencing
  - single-molecule epigenomics
  - chromatin accessibility
  - nucleosome positioning
  - dna methylation
license: MIT
version: 0.4.0
date-released: '2026-06-21'
